<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wind River.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wind River.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist Thursday raised its Q497 estimate to $0.20/shr from $0.19/shr and increased its fiscal 1998 estimates to $0.81/shr from $0.74/shr, citing higher than expected third qtr results of $0.19/shr.</p>
<p>-- Maintains buy rating.</p>
</text>
